Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:06.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The balls are wrapped\Nin a veil of my spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:11.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The balls glimmer gold,\Nabout five centimeters in diameter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You'll recognize it the instant you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nope, it's not anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:18.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's impossible!\NWe'll never find anything that small!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:23.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you searched this hard and you can't find it,\Nthen someone probably took them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:27.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The balls are filled\Nwith a powerful life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:31.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Spirits and yokai monsters\Nare drawn to stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:36.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They believe they'll come back to life\Nif they gather enough items with high life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:42.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why evil spirits attack people,\Nand try to steal life force from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:45.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't that bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If someone takes them,\Nthere's no way to look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:52.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like I care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're the one who lost them!\N- Ow! Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You look for it with us, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You goddamn turds!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:03.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, hold on, that hurts, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:07.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This treatment... I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We should go home for now\Nand think of a different strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:12.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:13.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:19.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you have no leads,\Nthere's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:23.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll ask people I know\Nif they have ball intel, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ball intel?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:30.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Also, don't forget that you still have\NTurbo Granny's powers inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:36.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seems it's not going haywire this time,\Nbut it's still a dangerous power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:38.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stay put until you figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:39.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:49.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:51.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you going out with Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, no, I'm not dating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:57.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that right? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:00.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then can you introduce us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:03.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ayase is super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:05.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been wanting\Nto get to know her for a while now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:08.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}cute!?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:11.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never even considered that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:13.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was just happy\Nthat I made my first friend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:18.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But wait, if I think about it,\Nshe might be cute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:20.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, wait!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:21.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase is my friend!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:24.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thinking she's cute is bad!\NThat's impure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:26.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So you guys have, like, done it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:27.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:29.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Rumors say she'll sleep with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:32.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Who'd say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:34.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Dunno. But it's true, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:39.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who is spreading those rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:43.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:49.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I asked you who was spreading\Nsuch rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ya see, Momo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,ain't that kind of girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:59.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's best not to spread rumors like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:02.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not me! I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:05.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I get it, so let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.41,0:03:07.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down! Calm down!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:28.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like you're havin' a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:47.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I haven't been to a school in centuries.\NIt's gotten so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:49.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What're you doing here of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In the first place, aren't you quarantined\Nin Miss Ayase's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:58.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seiko said, "Cat, you can roam free.\NYou can't do anything anyway."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:01.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can see her saying that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:03.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, aren't you in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:07.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That power is way too heavy\Nof a burden for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:11.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You should let me inside\Nyour body once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:17.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll leave as soon as\NI regain my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:20.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a really simple process.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:21.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You returning my balls\Nto me comes first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:25.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't fall for slick talk like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whatcha up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! Actually, right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Inside this is Tur—\N- Shh! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:42.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...bo Gra...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ayase is super cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,C-Cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:51.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:53.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you shying away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, well, it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:59.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And like, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you running from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'll kill your punk ass!\N- Why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Guess I'll enjoy campus life\Nfor the first time in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:15.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, why you so mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:21.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Something happen with your bae?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For some reason he's totally avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:26.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm seriously pissed.\NAnd he ain't my boyfriend, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? That came from nowhere.\NWhatcha talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard from someone in Class C.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:37.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun got in a fight with boys\Nwho were badmouthing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:43.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seems someone is spreading\Nnasty rumors about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I heard he got pissed about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then why is he avoiding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am just too pretty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:59.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone's eyes are glued to me\Nwhen I'm just walking down the hall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I'm not just cute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:06.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I even greet the local blockheads\Nwith a smile.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:11.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}By believing that a pretty girl likes them,\Nthey can live another day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am a pretty girl who is also kind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:19.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But someone as perfect as myself\Nhas things to get super upset about.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:24.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to get back at that bitch,\Nso I spread rumors that she's a slut.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the rumor isn't spreading much.\NSo maddening!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}They just don't get it at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I saw it clearly back then.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:42.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She had demon wings on her back!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:47.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Momo Ayase.\NShe's definitely a demon!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:52.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But since I suddenly became\Nable to see things like that,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:57.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}then I must be a chosen individual!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:06:59.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had hunches that I was.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:02.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, I'm all too pretty!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:06.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}As proof, this fell down from the sky.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}A golden ball!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:13.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is telling me to save this world\Nfrom evil demons!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:20.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it! I'll do it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:23.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I mean, after all, I am a pretty girl!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:01.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:05.77,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 6\NA DANGEROUS WOMAN ARRIVES
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:04.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ow! So annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:05.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A marble?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:18.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I brought that thing you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I only borrowed it, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:04.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I finally have all the equipment I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.87,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,HOLY BLESSINGS\NAND BANISHMENT PRAYERS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:15.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Doesn't this smell oily?\NIs this cross genuine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:17.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, are you really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:24.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have been chosen\Nbecause I'm just too beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I must save the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:33.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll believe you because I'm your friend,\Nbut Aira, you've been weird lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:37.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What you're trying to do now\Nis kinda strange, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a second! What is that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:43.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a woman in a red dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:50.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry. We don't see it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.67,0:10:52.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It can't be! That must be her familiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:56.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo Ayase is trying to spy on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:11:00.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Both of you, get low!\NHer familiar will find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shiratori, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:06.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a bit hot today,\Nso I was feeling how cold the wall is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shiratori, you're such a ditz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:14.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, I am not!\NBut people often say that I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}So pesky.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:19.15,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,WE'RE GONNA DO IT AFTER SCHOOL.\NYOU CAN'T TELL ANYONE ABOUT IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You really are a ditz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh no, you're getting Aira in trouble!\N- Right? Yeah, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:32.58,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.25,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:36.05,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:39.59,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm watching over Turbo Granny\Nso she doesn't run off somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.80,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You won't be able to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:44.55,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, why is Granny at school!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:47.97,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do I have to take orders\Nfrom ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:50.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Cuz you lost against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:52.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Bring it on, punk! I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yeah! Come at me!\N- I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:59.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, Turbo Granny said\Nshe found a strange woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:01.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't we talk about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:06.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right. Don't think I was just\Nsimply strolling around the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:08.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was looking for them golden balls, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:13.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Why would the golden balls\Nbe at school, idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:15.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, you're dead meat.\NGoodbye to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:17.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's worth a search, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:22.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't think about it, but there's a possibility\Nthat a human, and not a yokai, picked them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:25.14,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It looks like a pretty ball made of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.64,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be a surprise\Nif anyone picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:34.06,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,However, if a human picked it up,\Nit might awaken their spiritual powers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:36.27,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and depending on the person,\Nallow them to see spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:41.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The fact they can see spirits means\Nthe spirits can see them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's the danger\Nthat they might get attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:47.24,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's terrible.\NYou should've said so earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.20,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who is this strange woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:56.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll go introduce her to you after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Momo Ayase!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:01.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just how much power does she have?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:06.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I defeat her with just the cross\Nand the holy book they got for me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:09.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, she has a familiar.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:13.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I take both of them on at once?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's getting closer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}The woman in the red dress!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:23.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:26.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, time to go look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:27.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where's Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:28.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's in my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Momo Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:38.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you. Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:42.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What? I'm busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:46.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It'll be over quickly, so please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This girl is the one\Nwho I dropped the washtub onto.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has she caught onto something?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.97,0:13:54.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It might get annoying later,\Nso I guess I'll go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:57.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, go ahead and start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll join you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:13:58.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:01.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:05.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, brother. I'm not sure\Nif I can look for it alone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:07.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:18.29,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You brought me all the way here.\NWhat'd you wanna talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.18,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Die, demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:33.01,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It stinks! It smells oily! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:36.31,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,O demon, return to the world\Nyou belong in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:40.44,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold her legs!\NMake sure she doesn't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:44.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:52.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There they are! The demon wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The cross isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.03,0:14:55.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:01.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I use the golden ball\NI received from the heavens...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:04.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So you picked up the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You know about this ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:11.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't give this ball to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:15.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is a sacred ball\Nthat I was given to save the world with!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:19.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! That's Okarun's family jewels!\NGive it back, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:20.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:24.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How dare you say that\Nto the sacred ball! How vulgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:25.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch! Are you\Na complete idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:29.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't revere someone else's\Nnutsack so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:31.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! You're a serious lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:36.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's got your ball!\NShe's the strange woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's on her side?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's not true!\NShe's not the strange woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's the one who's being targeted\Nby the strange woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:51.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I finally have you now, Aira.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:16:00.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been waiting all this time\Nuntil you became able to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:10.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here's Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:11.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The familiar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:17.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:24.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you after my little Aira?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were a demon, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, I hate this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel so withered...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:44.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't let you have Aira!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:47.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:49.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you just be eating him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:51.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:55.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My hands are tied\Nso I can't control it the way I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We finally meet, Aira.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:15.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I waited for over ten years\Nfor you to look at me, Aira.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:18.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, you! You're not\NMomo Ayase's familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:21.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't "Hey you" me, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am your Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just how much do you think\Nthat I've loved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:30.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You called me Mommy back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:32.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was so happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:35.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was the first time\Nyou said anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:38.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please call me that one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:43.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, call me Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, damn old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:46.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give Okarun back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:52.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought assaulting humans\Nwas against the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:54.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Each and every one of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am in the middle\Nof an emotional reunion here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:00.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold it, Momo Ayase!\NWhat in the world is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it possible that you're enemies\Nwith this demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:06.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If so, why don't we cooperate\Nand defeat this demon together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:08.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whew, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was about to be that thing's side dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:16.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:21.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's Acrobatic Silky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:23.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, that's Muko's phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You pilfered it to do internet searches?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:31.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's see. A red dress, acrobatic movements,\Nand silky hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:34.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a yokai yourself,\Nbut you don't know anything about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:38.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care about rookie nobodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:42.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am a chosen one!\NBecause I'm too pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:45.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I defeat monsters like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira-chan, what did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:53.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm going to defeat monsters like you,\Nand uphold world peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:59.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Knock it off! Why are you\Nchomping 'em all down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:01.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:05.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You tempted Aira\Ninto becoming a delinquent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:07.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She called me a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:11.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She would never have said that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:13.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Granny, hurry up and get this zip tie off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:14.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, cooperate a little bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:18.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She just ate Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This'll be bad for me to face alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:23.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys were the ones\Nwho took my power from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.93,0:19:25.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't do anything for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,First, how about you apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:37.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all your fault, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:42.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:43.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Girgle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:51.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My acrobatics are like a violent storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ensnaring anything and everything,\Nthen swing them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:00.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:04.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, you're such a hopeless child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:10.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is Aira's special privilege, but if you want\Nto say it that badly, you may.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:14.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Try saying "Mommy" right now.\NI'll forgive you if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:16.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:25.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have to say it properly.\NReady? "M-O-M-M-Y."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:29.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you to say it, damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:30.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Say, "Mommy"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:31.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:33.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:46.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where is my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:50.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on now, you got gobbled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:56.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm still willing to forgive you,\Nso return the brats you swallowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:01.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you?\NCan you not speak to me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:05.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't you speak politely, punk!\NI am your elder by far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:08.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've got a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:14.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A beckoning cat supposedly has the ability\Nto beckon over some good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:18.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You ate some hair when you ate Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:20.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this!? My hair is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:24.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's burning inside my body, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:26.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What did you do to me,\Nyou foul feline?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:31.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That cross that the girl\Nwas holding was a lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:37.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo took that lighter\Nand lit your hair on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:40.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's nothing combustible\Ninside your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:44.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But you coincidentally ate your own hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:49.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Such fortuity becomes inevitability\Nbecause I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:21:59.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:01.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, that's being too reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:05.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Okarun, you were the first to be eaten!\NDon't preach to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:07.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Rescue successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:10.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Time for the counterattack, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:47.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will uphold peace in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:54.87,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7\NTO A KINDER WORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.82,0:23:54.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode, "To a Kinder World"
